1
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:20,137
Did you know there's an awesome
treasure hidden at the end of the sea?

2
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:22,857
And anyone who finds it,
the King of the Pirates!

3
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:24,397
Is that exciting or what?

4
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:28,127
There are incredible adventures
out there just waiting for us!

5
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:32,437
Bon voyage!

6
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:35,340
Have the courage that sail and believe,

7
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:39,137
and we will see a glimpse of

8
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:43,460
the sun rising on our tomorrow.

9
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:50,620
Back when we first started,
we had separate horizons,

10
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:52,957
sailed toward different dreams.

11
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:57,197
Things have changed now,
for together we found.

12
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:59,817
We look through the spyglass and see.

13
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:05,457
And we know that our hearts
have brought us here.

14
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:09,137
Where the conscious point's our destiny.

15
00:01:09,220 --> 00:01:13,040
There's no looking back,
take the hell with me!

16
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:17,197
Bon voyage, we can't
stop all our troubles.

17
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:19,497
Forget the past.

18
00:01:19,580 --> 00:01:24,117
Though the future's
unclear, we still can smile.

19
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:28,397
We know we'll get there, no regrets.

20
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:33,740
Every tear that we've cried
only helps our dreams come true.

21
00:01:34,580 --> 00:01:39,720
You and those dreams
are precious in my life.

22
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:46,400
A glimpse of the sun
rising on our tomorrow?

23
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:04,420
Almost there.

24
00:02:05,220 --> 00:02:07,437
I can't wait to see the
look on all their faces

25
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:10,285
when they find out I
discovered the gold first.

26
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,740
Look at those ruins!

27
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:27,817
What's up with this place?

28
00:02:27,900 --> 00:02:29,371
