31
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,230
No, Holy!

32
00:02:44,313 --> 00:02:45,143
Stay!

33
00:02:45,226 --> 00:02:46,056
Stay!

34
00:02:46,139 --> 00:02:46,980
I said stay!

35
00:02:58,300 --> 00:02:59,700
What was I thinking?

36
00:03:00,020 --> 00:03:02,257
I'm too little to do this all by myself!

37
00:03:02,340 --> 00:03:03,752
I should have gone back!

38
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:07,850
Interesting.

39
00:03:08,260 --> 00:03:11,240
You're the third one to
make it this far today.

40
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:12,960
Who are you?

41
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:18,457
Can't believe that spider-headed
fool was so careless you

42
00:03:18,540 --> 00:03:22,800
killed Geratsu didn't you I guess
he means that guy from earlier

43
00:03:24,860 --> 00:03:28,297
I suppose it's for the best the world is

44
00:03:28,380 --> 00:03:31,204
better off with one less
imbecile when you agree

45
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,110
Tripped over.

46
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:52,920
Calm yourself.

47
00:03:53,260 --> 00:03:55,337
There's no need to be so afraid of Holy.

48
00:03:55,420 --> 00:03:56,479
He's merely a pet.

49
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:57,780
He won't bite you.

50
00:03:57,980 --> 00:03:59,037
What about this guy?

51
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:01,885
It looks like he's been
chewed up and spit out.

52
