67
00:04:37,080 --> 00:04:40,097
Yet time after time they
throw themselves into battle.

68
00:04:40,180 --> 00:04:42,977
Only to lose their
lives along with the joy

69
00:04:43,060 --> 00:04:46,717
they struggled so hard to
find what a strange and

70
