way to be redeemed and
that is for all men to die.

72
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:58,797
Oh please sir you don't
really mean that do

73
00:04:58,880 --> 00:05:03,220
you this is bad what
have you come here for?

74
00:05:03,900 --> 00:05:08,440
Oh i was just trying to find the city
of gold greed only leads to ruin.

75
00:05:09,300 --> 00:05:11,217
You must be rescued.

76
00:05:11,300 --> 00:05:13,660
