77
00:05:18,780 --> 00:05:22,662
Only losing your life will save
you from all your earthly desires.

78
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:26,420
He doesn't want to rescue me at all!

79
00:05:37,460 --> 00:05:38,820
Kamakiri! Kamakiri!

80
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:43,830
Go.

81
00:05:44,140 --> 00:05:45,600
Get out of here, Lock.

82
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:48,060
