Alright, I understand.

89
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:06,470
Now quiet.

90
00:06:06,553 --> 00:06:07,383
Save your strength.

91
00:06:10,700 --> 00:06:13,540
Nobody can beat Eneru.

92
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:17,540
