94
00:06:29,540 --> 00:06:33,834
He comes as lightning, an element that
man has feared from the beginning.

95
00:06:34,060 --> 00:06:35,440
And rightly so.

96
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:37,800
He can't be conquered.

97
00:06:39,100 --> 00:06:40,980
Don't worry, I'll stop Wiper.

98
