shouldn't matter.

117
00:07:52,340 --> 00:07:53,170
You dummy.

118
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:02,140
No, no, no.

119
00:08:02,380 --> 00:08:05,140
Hey, let go of that,
you better break, jerk.

120
00:08:05,420 --> 00:08:07,185
