126
00:08:30,220 --> 00:08:32,500
Maybe, maybe it's a trick door.

127
00:08:34,020 --> 00:08:35,420
Let's find out.

128
00:08:35,800 --> 00:08:38,800
I can always try busting
through this stupid thing.

129
00:08:39,420 --> 00:08:43,000
Come, come, bazooka!

130
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:50,720
But it, it didn't even butch.

131
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:59,760
Not again!

132
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:21,560
He didn't follow me. I'm okay.

133
00:09:24,940 --> 00:09:26,540
I bet he's a priest, too.

134
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:29,957
