138
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:42,896
He looked like a swordsman, so if I
keep my distance, I should be okay.

139
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:45,030
Huh.

140
00:09:45,113 --> 00:09:46,480
He's run quite a long way.

141
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:50,220
But running from salvation is futile.

142
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:54,900
Attachment to this life is
a result of evil desires.

143
