The path to peace leads to but one place.

145
00:10:19,420 --> 00:10:21,140
This is the ordeal of iron.

146
00:10:21,280 --> 00:10:22,980
The survival rate is zero.

147
00:10:25,260 --> 00:10:26,090
Isa?

148
00:10:26,173 --> 00:10:27,097
I can't just sit here.

149
00:10:27,180 --> 00:10:28,557
I've got to go find Lock.

150
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:29,699
Oh, no, you don't.

151
00:10:31,040 --> 00:10:32,200
Wait, Isa!

152
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:33,730
Isa!

153
00:10:37,580 --> 00:10:38,740
Get back here!

154
00:10:38,860 --> 00:10:39,742
Leave me alone!

155
00:10:39,940 --> 00:10:41,137
I've got to save Lock!

156
00:10:41,220 --> 00:10:42,050
Let go!

157
00:10:42,133 --> 00:10:43,457
I've got to get out of here right now!

158
00:10:43,540 --> 00:10:44,370
Let go!

159
00:10:44,453 --> 00:10:45,837
This isn't any of your business!

160
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:47,397
Maybe it's not any of my business?

161
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,797
But there's no way I'm going to sit back!

162
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:50,697
and let a little kid get herself killed!

163
00:10:50,780 --> 00:10:51,780
