164
00:10:52,180 --> 00:10:53,237
Yeah, yeah, I know.

165
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,150
Kid warrior.

166
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:57,875
Hey, those dirty looks don't
scare me, so knock it off!

167
00:10:58,920 --> 00:11:00,660
