168
00:11:01,380 --> 00:11:02,210
We're fine.

169
00:11:02,293 --> 00:11:05,102
All right, stop messing
around and get the waver.

170
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,557
You don't understand.

171
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:09,977
You have to let me go so
I can save my friends.

172
00:11:10,060 --> 00:11:10,890
I have to help them.

173
00:11:10,973 --> 00:11:13,937
