177
00:11:21,420 --> 00:11:23,479
Come on, I'll help you in the boat.

178
00:11:33,520 --> 00:11:34,350
WAAA!

179
00:11:36,220 --> 00:11:37,050
Huh?

180
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,120
Oh no.

181
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:48,110
Okay.

182
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,680
That was scary.

183
