197
00:12:38,180 --> 00:12:39,709
It's gone into the forest!

198
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:47,480
Missed! Ha!

199
00:12:48,380 --> 00:12:49,520
You're lucky!

200
00:13:03,220 --> 00:13:04,050
Huh?

201
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:05,260
