203
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:11,718
Something's coming!

204
00:13:16,860 --> 00:13:18,960
Go that way! That way!

205
00:13:20,800 --> 00:13:22,060
Lord of the sky!

206
00:13:22,540 --> 00:13:24,200
No way! Aissa!

207
00:13:44,940 --> 00:13:48,100
We're inside the forest.

208
00:13:51,700 --> 00:13:54,560
Um, hey, what's the idea?

209
00:13:55,580 --> 00:13:57,286
Are you even listening to me?

210
00:13:59,260 --> 00:14:02,220
I'm going to pluck you
and cook you up in a stew!

211
00:14:15,560 --> 00:14:18,000
