216
00:14:50,380 --> 00:14:51,600
Why you!

217
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:12,539
To make it to God's Shrine, I have
to climb to the top of Giant Jack.

218
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:19,180
And if Eneru is there, it's time I
brought an end to our terrible history.

219
00:15:19,800 --> 00:15:20,840
Once and for all.

220
00:15:23,180 --> 00:15:24,010
Now.

221
