have permission to pass?

223
00:15:47,640 --> 00:15:48,580
Damn you.

224
00:15:51,300 --> 00:15:52,640
It doesn't matter.

225
00:15:53,300 --> 00:15:55,829
Adding for that shrine
is no longer useful.

226
