I've recently come from God's shrine.

231
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:21,180
It's tragic.

232
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:23,991
The entire thing's been utterly destroyed.

233
00:16:31,460 --> 00:16:34,180
Naturally, Aniru was nowhere to be found.

234
00:16:36,540 --> 00:16:40,340
Perhaps it means he no
longer has any need for it.

235
00:16:42,700 --> 00:16:45,720
It appears that their years
of hard labor are over.

236
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:49,220
