no longer useful to me.

237
00:16:49,680 --> 00:16:51,856
I've simply come to bid you farewell.

238
00:16:56,520 --> 00:17:00,357
I demand to know ohm what is it
you and your master seek to do?

239
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:04,280
hold on you saying energy's not up there!

240
00:17:22,180 --> 00:17:24,300
one of Straw Hats friends

241
