249
00:17:52,480 --> 00:17:56,900
If it isn't another greedy infidel
seeking his salvation, Enough!

250
00:17:57,380 --> 00:18:00,440
Get out of my way or I'll
destroy every one of you!

251
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:02,014
The time has come, Om.

252
00:18:02,500 --> 00:18:05,147
Tell me where Eneru and
the Divine Squad are.

253
00:18:08,860 --> 00:18:10,280
You stupid cave!

254
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:11,560
Just let me out!

255
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:26,437
I'm sure you each feel what
you have to say is important.

256
00:18:26,520 --> 00:18:28,457
But there's only one way for your voice to

257
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:31,800
be heard you must survive
or find salvation.

258
00:18:39,340 --> 00:18:44,757
Let's go holy be as ferocious
as you want boy that one

259
00:18:44,840 --> 00:18:48,075
is our target pierre since
he is the The most powerful,

260
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:50,513
we must neutralize Eneru's priest first!

261
00:18:55,120 --> 00:18:57,355
I'm really getting sick of you, Snake.

262
00:18:57,820 --> 00:19:00,761
I mean, how the hell'd you
get way up here anyway?

263
00:19:05,020 --> 00:19:06,220
Oh, damn it!

264
00:19:06,640 --> 00:19:09,740
One minute this place is
up, the other it's down.

265
00:19:13,180 --> 00:19:15,280
This is one messed up cave.

266
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:21,060
Well, I guess the three of you...

267
00:19:22,740 --> 00:19:24,720
will just have to die together!

268
00:19:37,860 --> 00:19:40,213
You need to work on your aim there, pal.

269
00:19:41,220 --> 00:19:42,749
Insolent blue sea dweller.

270
00:19:42,960 --> 00:19:45,797
You think you can just come to this
land and take what's rightfully ours?

271
00:19:45,880 --> 00:19:48,537
You have no idea how long
and hard we've struggled

272
00:19:48,620 --> 00:19:51,537
if you sky people want to
blow each other to pieces.

273
00:19:51,620 --> 00:19:52,796
That's your business

274
00:19:54,300 --> 00:19:57,500
It's like I told that
priest I couldn't care less.

275
00:19:58,700 --> 00:20:00,540
That figures I!

276
00:20:04,500 --> 00:20:06,853
Should have finished you from the start.

277
00:20:10,260 --> 00:20:11,100
Damn.

278
00:20:14,180 --> 00:20:16,780
This guy's actually
tougher than I thought.

279
00:20:29,180 --> 00:20:30,440
Now die!

280
00:20:48,500 --> 00:20:50,120
All right, note to self.

281
00:20:50,460 --> 00:20:52,931
Gotta watch out for those poisonous fangs.

282
00:20:58,940 --> 00:21:00,380
Speaking of fangs.

283
00:21:04,160 --> 00:21:04,990
Whoa.

284
00:21:05,520 --> 00:21:07,932
Oh, I've never seen a dog move like that.

285
00:21:08,760 --> 00:21:10,780
Not many people have, friend.

286
00:21:11,420 --> 00:21:16,126
You'll find that Holy knows a great number
of commands beyond just sit and stay.

287
00:21:16,440 --> 00:21:19,911
I'm a sky breeder, renowned
for my special animal training.

288
00:21:20,340 --> 00:21:22,757
I've trained him how to
walk upright on two legs

289
00:21:22,840 --> 00:21:25,546
and to box just like a
champion prize fighter.

290
00:21:25,700 --> 00:21:26,582
Show him, Holy.

291
00:21:29,820 --> 00:21:30,840
Nice doggie.

292
00:21:40,800 --> 00:21:43,271
Godfar, you were already beaten by Shit.

293
00:21:43,460 --> 00:21:44,857
Don't you know when to quit?

294
00:21:44,940 --> 00:21:46,705
What do you really hope to do?

295
00:21:46,800 --> 00:21:50,177
I doubt you even have enough
strength left to wield that spear.

296
00:21:50,260 --> 00:21:52,480
I don't know what Eneru is plotting,

297
00:21:52,800 --> 00:21:55,860
but I will stop him with
my dying breath if need be.

298
00:21:58,160 --> 00:22:00,517
There's no way a washed-up god like you

299
00:22:00,600 --> 00:22:02,957
could ever understand
Eneru's noble thoughts.

300
00:22:03,040 --> 00:22:08,080
Godfile, you're a foolish old man, a
man that doesn't have long to live.

301
00:22:16,320 --> 00:22:17,220
After them!

302
00:22:17,500 --> 00:22:19,441
Don't let the Shendorians escape!

303
00:22:23,340 --> 00:22:24,170
What the?

304
00:22:24,360 --> 00:22:25,820
Hey, you hear that?

305
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:27,860
It sounded like... goats!

306
00:22:28,200 --> 00:22:29,200
The Divine Squad!

307
00:22:29,340 --> 00:22:30,877
If they catch us, they'll kill us!

308
00:22:30,960 --> 00:22:33,120
The Divine Squad? Who are they?

309
00:22:33,440 --> 00:22:34,911
They're Aniru's soldiers!

310
00:22:35,040 --> 00:22:36,393
Get us out of here now!

311
00:22:36,520 --> 00:22:41,167
I'd love to, but in case you haven't
noticed, I have no idea where we're going!

312
00:22:54,880 --> 00:22:58,100
That stupid snake keeps getting in my way!

313
00:23:10,940 --> 00:23:12,057
Chopper! No!

314
00:23:12,140 --> 00:23:13,640
I'm coming! Hang on!

315
00:23:16,180 --> 00:23:17,080
I see.

316
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:19,400
He was part of your Blue Sea crew.

317
00:23:21,160 --> 00:23:23,760
Hey, watch his step over there.

318
00:23:32,340 --> 00:23:33,617
What the...

319
00:23:33,700 --> 00:23:34,740
Barbed wire?

320
00:23:37,880 --> 00:23:39,640
So that's his ordeal.

321
00:23:40,800 --> 00:23:42,420
Chopper, talk to me!

322
00:23:43,220 --> 00:23:45,420
Say something! Why?

323
00:23:45,620 --> 00:23:47,796
Why did you try and take this guy on?

324
00:23:48,120 --> 00:23:48,980
Come on!

325
00:23:49,340 --> 00:23:50,680
A shame, isn't it?

326
00:23:54,340 --> 00:23:56,440
Those barbs, Iron Cloud.

327
00:23:56,960 --> 00:23:59,557
Their light is a cloud, but hard as iron.

328
00:23:59,640 --> 00:24:01,940
blown into shape by a milky dial.

329
00:24:02,620 --> 00:24:04,637
I've rigged several of
them with hidden triggers.

330
00:24:04,720 --> 00:24:09,297
You and your little friend found out the
hard way what happens when you step on one.

331
00:24:09,380 --> 00:24:10,800
This field is a weapon.

332
00:24:11,040 --> 00:24:12,377
I don't have to attack you.

333
00:24:12,460 --> 00:24:15,695
I can sit back and watch your
own blundering do you in.

334
00:24:16,680 --> 00:24:21,092
I'm partially responsible for that
animal's defeat, but he's also to blame.

335
00:24:21,260 --> 00:24:24,120
He stumbled into my ordeal all by himself.

336
00:24:30,080 --> 00:24:33,660
I guess you'll want to
get revenge now, huh? No.

337
00:24:35,660 --> 00:24:39,954
Believe it or not, I normally don't
like fighting for that reason at all.

338
00:24:40,600 --> 00:24:41,430
Oh.

339
00:24:42,020 --> 00:24:44,120
I'm actually impressed. Normally.

340
00:24:48,040 --> 00:24:50,180
But you've changed my mind.

341
00:25:03,240 --> 00:25:05,440
Well, Conis, I think we've arrived.

342
00:25:05,740 --> 00:25:09,657
This is the seashore where our Blue Sea
friends are planning to meet, right?

343
00:25:09,740 --> 00:25:10,570
Yes, Father.

344
00:25:10,720 --> 00:25:13,057
This is where Nami told me
they'd be dropping anchor.

345
00:25:13,140 --> 00:25:15,081
Well, then what should we do now?

346
00:25:15,300 --> 00:25:18,300
I really wasn't expecting
to look after their ship.

347
00:25:18,580 --> 00:25:22,286
Nonetheless, we must protect it
at all costs until they return.

348
00:25:22,440 --> 00:25:25,520
I'll sound the horn to scare
off any threats. Right.

349
00:25:25,680 --> 00:25:26,900
Good idea, Father.

350
00:25:27,380 --> 00:25:29,060
Let them hear our resolve.

351
00:25:34,160 --> 00:25:35,220
Ah, perfect.

352
00:25:40,400 --> 00:25:41,871
Keep your eyes open, Sue.

353
00:25:42,100 --> 00:25:44,100
I'm counting on you to keep watch.

354
00:25:49,960 --> 00:25:50,790
Hang on.

355
00:25:50,960 --> 00:25:52,837
I'll nurse both of you back to health.

356
00:25:52,920 --> 00:25:54,567
You'll be better in no time.

357
00:26:02,220 --> 00:26:04,420
Please, everyone, be safe.

358
00:26:04,820 --> 00:26:07,300
I'm sorry the Sky Island is like this.

359
00:26:17,160 --> 00:26:19,840
Don't stop until we've taken Edaru's head!

360
00:26:20,760 --> 00:26:23,800
The only heads that are
all are yours, Shandora!

361
00:26:24,920 --> 00:26:26,520
Climb up to your church!

362
00:26:27,340 --> 00:26:30,020
Don't let them get to God's shrine! No!

363
00:26:35,460 --> 00:26:38,700
Wiper, please don't
use the reject anymore!

364
00:26:39,280 --> 00:26:40,780
Now, Divine Squad!

365
00:26:41,140 --> 00:26:42,680
Let's kill them all!

366
00:26:53,240 --> 00:26:55,480
Don't challenge Eneru, Wiper!

367
00:27:01,340 --> 00:27:04,680
He can't be defeated,
no matter what we do!

368
00:27:26,980 --> 00:27:27,810
That's right,

369
00:27:28,220 --> 00:27:30,260
those of you still in the game,

370
00:27:30,440 --> 00:27:34,540
climb your way to the upper
ruins and destroy each other.

371
00:27:38,460 --> 00:27:41,060
There will only be five survivors.

372
00:27:44,340 --> 00:27:47,780
My words and prophecies are absolute!

373
00:27:58,840 --> 00:28:01,420
Stop this insanity now, Wiper!

374
00:28:01,820 --> 00:28:02,650
I'm not here to...

375
00:28:02,733 --> 00:28:03,637
You're not what, old man?

376
00:28:03,720 --> 00:28:05,896
You believe that you're not my enemy?

377
00:28:06,900 --> 00:28:10,477
To the Shandians, there's no
difference between you and Eneru!

378
00:28:10,560 --> 00:28:11,736
Both of you must go!

379
00:28:11,840 --> 00:28:13,016
Quit being stubborn!

380
00:28:13,180 --> 00:28:14,220
Listen to reason!

381
00:28:21,640 --> 00:28:22,480
Damn you!

382
00:28:32,920 --> 00:28:35,508
My burn bazooka didn't
even faze that thing.

383
00:28:35,740 --> 00:28:37,505
What are those scales made of?

384
00:28:44,760 --> 00:28:45,590
No!

385
00:28:45,673 --> 00:28:46,503
No more!

386
00:28:46,780 --> 00:28:47,900
I'm sick of this!

387
00:28:52,680 --> 00:28:54,520
Ah! Ah!

388
00:28:55,220 --> 00:29:04,210
Ah!

389
00:29:04,560 --> 00:29:05,390
Ah! Ah!

390
00:29:05,980 --> 00:29:06,810
Ah!

391
00:29:06,893 --> 00:29:07,723
Ah! Ah!

392
00:29:07,806 --> 00:29:08,636
Ah!

393
00:29:08,719 --> 00:29:09,860
What... was that?

394
00:29:10,400 --> 00:29:11,230
Hm.

395
00:29:11,580 --> 00:29:14,345
Typical Blue Sea Dweller,
you didn't expect it.

396
00:29:15,120 --> 00:29:18,837
You see, this sword of mine
is also made of Iron Cloud.

397
00:29:18,920 --> 00:29:20,820
In other words,

398
00:29:21,100 --> 00:29:24,337
the blade itself is actually
Iron Cloud expelled from

399
00:29:24,420 --> 00:29:27,137
a dial that's conveniently
embedded in the sword's hilt.

400
00:29:27,220 --> 00:29:30,220
And it will hunt its prey
to the ends of the earth!

401
00:29:33,900 --> 00:29:37,841
Well, do you understand it better
now, swordsman from the Blue Sea?

402
00:29:38,180 --> 00:29:39,827
Yeah, it's just like a whip.

403
00:29:40,140 --> 00:29:41,060
I get it.

404
00:29:41,280 --> 00:29:45,339
You white, white sea people are more
circus performers than warriors.

405
00:29:52,120 --> 00:29:54,826
Holy, we're going to
have to fight separately.

406
00:29:59,200 --> 00:30:03,259
From the sound of things, the Upper
Ruins are about to get very busy.

407
00:30:17,140 --> 00:30:18,400
The Sky Knight.

408
00:30:18,640 --> 00:30:20,464
I didn't expect him to be here.

409
00:30:20,780 --> 00:30:23,280
We're here to assist you, oh mighty Ohm.

410
00:30:27,520 --> 00:30:28,900
Look who's here.

411
00:30:30,200 --> 00:30:32,024
Well, you know what this means.

412
00:30:32,500 --> 00:30:34,853
Yeah, it means we're the only ones left.

413
00:30:34,940 --> 00:30:36,017
Don't worry, Wiper.

414
00:30:36,100 --> 00:30:39,041
We'll help you get to Eneru
and take his head off.

415
00:30:44,860 --> 00:30:45,740
Hey, wait.

416
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:46,830
That should work.

417
00:30:46,913 --> 00:30:48,371
I'll just dig my way out.

418
00:30:56,140 --> 00:30:57,620
That giant snake!

419
00:31:02,160 --> 00:31:03,640
It's laughing?

420
00:31:09,720 --> 00:31:11,120
Hold it!

421
00:31:12,800 --> 00:31:15,960
Would you ghosts just leave us alone?

422
00:31:16,720 --> 00:31:19,800
Nami, Aissa, noob!

423
00:31:20,640 --> 00:31:21,720
Kill them both!

424
00:31:38,940 --> 00:31:41,940
Aisa, what are you doing here? What the?

425
00:31:42,140 --> 00:31:43,905
Nami, what are you doing here?

426
00:31:44,240 --> 00:31:47,640
Hey, Throw, what's happening? Wiper!

427
00:31:48,180 --> 00:31:51,121
What is it you're plotting
here, Blue Sea Dweller?

428
00:31:51,840 --> 00:31:53,664
Aisa, get away from that woman!

429
00:31:54,060 --> 00:31:54,890
Huh?

430
00:32:00,440 --> 00:32:02,860
That was close. Wiper!

431
00:32:03,320 --> 00:32:04,500
You're a monster!

432
00:32:05,860 --> 00:32:08,860
Why did you two come to
such a perilous place?

433
00:32:09,120 --> 00:32:10,240
We didn't mean to.

434
00:32:10,540 --> 00:32:14,720
We were chased by this giant snake.

435
00:32:20,540 --> 00:32:21,370
Ah!

436
00:32:21,453 --> 00:32:22,520
You idiot! Oh shit!

437
00:32:28,680 --> 00:32:29,510
Issie...

438
00:32:38,580 --> 00:32:39,410
WIPER!

439
00:32:44,320 --> 00:32:48,085
You were so distracted that you
neglected to protect yourselves.

440
00:32:48,620 --> 00:32:50,860
Quit worrying about other people!

441
00:32:52,420 --> 00:32:53,380
Accept it.

442
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:56,073
There's nothing you can do to save them.
